0..51 Comment "//! This source defines shared string declarations."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..133 Comment "//! Every string source reads byte storage through these declarations. A copy"
134..209 Comment "//! does not expose another string\'s write. Short strings use inline bytes."
210..256 Comment "//! Long strings share a buffer until a write."
257..260 Comment "//!"
261..339 Comment "//! `Repr` selects byte storage. The source provides byte functions and inline"
340..353 Comment "//! capacity."
